<!--
  English baseline strings for BHODL.
  Localisations land in sibling directories: values-it/strings.xml,
  values-es/strings.xml, etc. (compose-multiplatform-resources convention).

  Naming convention: <screen_or_area>_<element>_<intent>
  Examples: app_name, balance_hero_label, send_button_confirm.

  Phase-2 polish iteration: only the navigation chrome and the
  Settings screen are i18n-d for now. Send / History / Address book
  bodies stay hardcoded until the next i18n pass — touching them
  also rewires the Send flow tests we have heavy investment in.
-->
